			"notes": "Rewritten from scratch!\n- Emotes now render using the built-in minecraft font system, no more hacks, should be a lot more stable\n- Tooltips that show the emote name when hovering!\n- Added a gif decoder, no more weird conversions\n- With that, support for animated wide emotes!\n- Single-command BTTV emote importing\n- Local emote caching! No more waiting for emotes to fetch, your internet provider will thank me HYPERS\n\nThere's still a few things to change, they will come soon!"
